{"summary":"铸铧孔中黄土是从犁铧孔中收集的泥土，性平，主要用于治疗男性阴囊湿痒、阴汗，研细末外扑即可。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《拾遗》"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"丈夫阴囊湿痒，及阴汗，细末扑之（藏器）。","translation":"治疗男性阴囊湿痒以及阴部出汗，将黄土研成细末外扑患处。（藏器）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#鑄鏵孔中黃土","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}